"Noncommercial purposes" for purposes of this license means not primarily intended for or directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation. For purposes that do meet the definition, exchanging the software or works based on it for operational costs such as hosting, bandwidth, and storage is not commercial advantage or monetary compensation. For the avoidance of doubt, providing paid services on the software, selling the software, using the software to provide paid services, and other use primarily intended for or directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation are not noncommercial purposes.

